#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:28
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>Tcl</application> package contains the Tool Command "
"Language, a robust general-purpose scripting language. The "
"<application>Expect</application> package is written in "
"<application>Tcl</application> (pronounced \"tickle\")."
msgstr ""
"O pacote <application>Tcl</application> contém a Tool Command Language, uma "
"linguagem de script robusta de propósito geral. O pacote "
"<application>Expect</application> é escrito em "
"<application>Tcl</application> (pronunciada \"tickle\")."

