#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:45
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Tcl"
msgstr "Instalação do Tcl"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:47
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This package and the next two (Expect and DejaGNU) are installed to support "
"running the test suites for Binutils, GCC and other packages.  Installing "
"three packages for testing purposes may seem excessive, but it is very "
"reassuring, if not essential, to know that the most important tools are "
"working properly."
msgstr ""
"Esse pacote e os próximos dois (Expect e DejaGNU) são instalados para "
"suportar a execução das suítes de teste para Binutils, GCC e outros pacotes."
" Instalar três pacotes para propósitos de teste possivelmente pareça "
"excessivo, mas é muito assegurador, se não essencial, saber que as "
"ferramentas mais importantes estão funcionando adequadamente."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:53
#, xml-text
msgid "Prepare Tcl for compilation:"
msgstr "Prepare Tcl para compilação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:55
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">SRCDIR=$(pwd)\n"
"cd unix\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --mandir=/usr/share/man \\\n"
"            --disable-rpath</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">SRCDIR=$(pwd)\n"
"cd unix\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --mandir=/usr/share/man \\\n"
"            --disable-rpath</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:62
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the new configure parameters:"
msgstr "O significado dos novos parâmetros de configuração:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:65
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--disable-rpath</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--disable-rpath</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:67
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This parameter prevents hard coding library search paths (rpath) into the "
"binary executable files and shared libraries.  This package does not need "
"rpath for an installation into the standard location, and rpath may "
"sometimes cause unwanted effects or even security issues."
msgstr ""
"Esse parâmetro evita caminhos de pesquisa de biblioteca de codificação "
"rígida (rpath) dentro dos arquivos binários executáveis e das bibliotecas "
"compartilhadas. Esse pacote não precisa do rpath para uma instalação no "
"local padrão, e o rpath às vezes pode causar efeitos indesejados ou até "
"mesmo problemas de segurança."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:76
#, xml-text
msgid "Build the package:"
msgstr "Construa o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:78
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"make\">make\n"
"\n"
"sed -e \"s|$SRCDIR/unix|/usr/lib|\" \\\n"
"    -e \"s|$SRCDIR|/usr/include|\"  \\\n"
"    -i tclConfig.sh\n"
"\n"
"sed -e \"s|$SRCDIR/unix/pkgs/tdbc&tdbc-ver;|/usr/lib/tdbc&tdbc-ver;|\" \\\n"
"    -e \"s|$SRCDIR/pkgs/tdbc&tdbc-ver;/generic|/usr/include|\"     \\\n"
"    -e \"s|$SRCDIR/pkgs/tdbc&tdbc-ver;/library|/usr/lib/tcl8.6|\"  \\\n"
"    -e \"s|$SRCDIR/pkgs/tdbc&tdbc-ver;|/usr/include|\"             \\\n"
"    -i pkgs/tdbc&tdbc-ver;/tdbcConfig.sh\n"
"\n"
"sed -e \"s|$SRCDIR/unix/pkgs/itcl&itcl-ver;|/usr/lib/itcl&itcl-ver;|\" \\\n"
"    -e \"s|$SRCDIR/pkgs/itcl&itcl-ver;/generic|/usr/include|\"    \\\n"
"    -e \"s|$SRCDIR/pkgs/itcl&itcl-ver;|/usr/include|\"            \\\n"
"    -i pkgs/itcl&itcl-ver;/itclConfig.sh\n"
"\n"
"unset SRCDIR</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"make\">make\n"
"\n"
"sed -e \"s|$SRCDIR/unix|/usr/lib|\" \\\n"
"    -e \"s|$SRCDIR|/usr/include|\"  \\\n"
"    -i tclConfig.sh\n"
"\n"
"sed -e \"s|$SRCDIR/unix/pkgs/tdbc&tdbc-ver;|/usr/lib/tdbc&tdbc-ver;|\" \\\n"
"    -e \"s|$SRCDIR/pkgs/tdbc&tdbc-ver;/generic|/usr/include|\"     \\\n"
"    -e \"s|$SRCDIR/pkgs/tdbc&tdbc-ver;/library|/usr/lib/tcl8.6|\"  \\\n"
"    -e \"s|$SRCDIR/pkgs/tdbc&tdbc-ver;|/usr/include|\"             \\\n"
"    -i pkgs/tdbc&tdbc-ver;/tdbcConfig.sh\n"
"\n"
"sed -e \"s|$SRCDIR/unix/pkgs/itcl&itcl-ver;|/usr/lib/itcl&itcl-ver;|\" \\\n"
"    -e \"s|$SRCDIR/pkgs/itcl&itcl-ver;/generic|/usr/include|\"    \\\n"
"    -e \"s|$SRCDIR/pkgs/itcl&itcl-ver;|/usr/include|\"            \\\n"
"    -i pkgs/itcl&itcl-ver;/itclConfig.sh\n"
"\n"
"unset SRCDIR</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:97
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The various <quote>sed</quote> instructions after the <quote>make</quote> "
"command remove references to the build directory from the configuration "
"files and replace them with the install directory.  This is not mandatory "
"for the remainder of LFS, but may be needed if a package built later uses "
"Tcl."
msgstr ""
"As várias instruções <quote>sed</quote> depois do comando "
"<quote>make</quote> removem referências ao diretório de construção dos "
"arquivos de configuração e as substituem pelo diretório de instalação. Isso "
"não é obrigatório para o restante do LFS, porém possivelmente seja "
"necessário se um pacote construído posteriormente usar a Tcl."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:103
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue:"
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:105
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"test\">LC_ALL=C.UTF-8 make test</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"test\">LC_ALL=C.UTF-8 make test</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:107
#, xml-text
msgid "Install the package:"
msgstr "Instale o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:109
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">make install \n"
"chmod 644 /usr/lib/libtclstub&tcl-major-version;.a</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">make install \n"
"chmod 644 /usr/lib/libtclstub&tcl-major-version;.a</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:112
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Make the installed library writable so debugging symbols can be removed "
"later:"
msgstr ""
"Torne as bibliotecas instaladas graváveis, de modo que símbolos de depuração"
" possam ser removidos posteriormente:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:115
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">chmod -v u+w /usr/lib/libtcl&tcl-major-"
"version;.so</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">chmod -v u+w /usr/lib/libtcl&tcl-major-"
"version;.so</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:117
#, xml-text
msgid "Install Tcl's headers. The next package, Expect, requires them."
msgstr "Instale os cabeçalhos da Tcl. O próximo pacote, Expect, exige elas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:119
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"install\">make install-private-headers</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"install\">make install-private-headers</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid "Now make a necessary symbolic link:"
msgstr "Agora faça um link simbólico necessário:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:123
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">ln -sfv tclsh&tcl-major-version; "
"/usr/bin/tclsh</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">ln -sfv tclsh&tcl-major-version; "
"/usr/bin/tclsh</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:125
#, xml-text
msgid "Rename a man page that conflicts with a Perl man page:"
msgstr ""
"Renomeie uma página de manual que conflita com uma página de manual do Perl:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:127
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">mv -v "
"/usr/share/man/man3/{Thread,Tcl_Thread}.3</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">mv -v /usr/share/man/man3/"
"{Thread,Tcl_Thread}.3</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Optionally, install the documentation by issuing the following commands:"
msgstr "Opcionalmente, instale a documentação emitindo os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/tcl.xml:132
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">cd ..\n"
"tar -xf ../tcl&tcl-version;-html.tar.gz --strip-components=1\n"
"mkdir -v -p /usr/share/doc/tcl-&tcl-version;\n"
"cp -v -r  ./html/* /usr/share/doc/tcl-&tcl-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">cd ..\n"
"tar -xf ../tcl&tcl-version;-html.tar.gz --strip-components=1\n"
"mkdir -v -p /usr/share/doc/tcl-&tcl-version;\n"
"cp -v -r  ./html/* /usr/share/doc/tcl-&tcl-version;</userinput>"

